{"title":"Ten:07 Unicorn Pony Ultra-Compact Cargo Bike Goes Titanium: A Bespoked Preview","link":"https://bikerumor.com/ten07-unicorn-pony-titanium-ultra-compact-all-terrain-cargo-bike-at-bespoked-dresden/","date":1789071291000,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike-1536x1024.jpg\" width=\"1536\" height=\"1024\" alt=\"Ten:07 Unicorn Pony Titanium ultra-compact cargo bike\" /></p>\n<p>Ten:07 is giving their cute little ultra-compact Unicorn Pony cargo bike a titanium upgrade, creating an even better reason to add a versatile hauler to your bike garage. This adorable little workhorse is set to debut at the Bespoked custom bike show in Dresden, Germany tomorrow. But Ten:07 gave us a sneak peek!</p>\n\n\n\n<h2>Ten:07 Unicorn Pony Titanium ultra-compact cargo bike</h2>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled.jpg\"><img width=\"1745\" height=\"1310\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled.jpg\" alt=\"Ten:07 Unicorn Pony Titanium ultra-compact cargo bike, angled\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled.jpg 1745w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled-297x223.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled-1536x1153.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled-120x90.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled-768x577.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled-1199x900.jpg 1199w\" /></a><figcaption><i>(All photos/Ten:07)</i></figcaption></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Kicking it up a notch in titanium. “<em>The fun-sized, highly anticipated mini cargo bike has been re-engineered in sexy titanium and equipped with Ten:07’s signature quick-release platform.</em>“</p>\n\n\n\n<p>We’ve secretly loved Ten:07’s reverse mullet compact Unicorn cargo bikes for years. Since about 2022, when we first learned of their steel cargo bike frames being manufactured in the Czech Republic. With their smart removable rack platform that made it much easier to store in tight spaces than most cargo-capable bikes. It all started with the Unicorn years ago, with a pretty normal-looking 700c rear end of the frame mated to a long cargo platform over a 20″ front wheel. </p>\n\n\n\n<p>But Ten:07 <a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/ten07-unicorn-pony-cargo-bike/\" target=\"_blank\">went ultra-compact earlier this year</a> with a 24″ rear wheel, a 20″ wheel up front, and a short but wide platform up front. They called this one the Unicorn Pony. You ended up with a cargo bike with a wheelbase shorter than most regular bikes. Meaning overall, it’s about 20-30cm shorter than most modern road or gravel bikes. Which means you have plenty of room to store a Unicorn Pony at home.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>No more excuses not to get a cargo bike!</p>\n\n\n\n<h3>What carries over?</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_quick-release-platform-detail.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_quick-release-platform-detail.jpg\" alt=\"Ten:07 Unicorn Pony Titanium ultra-compact cargo bike, quick-release from platform\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_quick-release-platform-detail.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_quick-release-platform-detail-297x178.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_quick-release-platform-detail-1536x922.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_quick-release-platform-detail-120x72.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_quick-release-platform-detail-768x461.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_quick-release-platform-detail-1500x900.jpg 1500w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The Unicorn Pony Titanium has the same dimensions as Ten:07’s original ultra-compact Unicorn Pony. Importantly, that means the same 1-meter long wheelbase, 20″ front &amp; 24″ rear wheels. The same 1544mm overall length and 500mm quick-release removable platform width. Take that off, and you just have to deal with handlebar width to fit this little pony in tight spaces.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>You get the same easy, “quick commuter” handling and load-carrying capabilities.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3>And what’s new? </h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_now-in-fancy-ti.jpg\"><img width=\"1365\" height=\"1950\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_now-in-fancy-ti.jpg\" alt=\"Ten:07 Unicorn Pony Titanium ultra-compact cargo bike, now in shiny ti\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_now-in-fancy-ti.jpg 1365w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_now-in-fancy-ti-210x300.jpg 210w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_now-in-fancy-ti-84x120.jpg 84w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_now-in-fancy-ti-768x1097.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_now-in-fancy-ti-1075x1536.jpg 1075w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_now-in-fancy-ti-630x900.jpg 630w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>But now it is in shiny titanium. Shinier, fancier, and “<em>noticeably lighter to carry up the stairs when the ride’s done</em>” than the steel frame version.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Never worry about scratching your cargo bike’s paint job. Never worry about rust.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Tech details</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled-rear.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1125\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled-rear.jpg\" alt=\"Ten:07 Unicorn Pony Titanium ultra-compact cargo bike, angled rear\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled-rear.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled-rear-297x167.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled-rear-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled-rear-120x68.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled-rear-768x432.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled-rear-1200x675.jpg 1200w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_angled-rear-1600x900.jpg 1600w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>titanium frame construction</li>\n\n\n\n<li>20″ front wheel + 24″ rear wheel, with off-road-capable tire clearance</li>\n\n\n\n<li>one-size-fits-most city bike riders</li>\n\n\n\n<li>signature Ten:07 Unicorn quick-release cargo platform</li>\n\n\n\n<li>500mm wide by 360mm long platform, with optional webbing straps</li>\n\n\n\n<li>front headlight &amp; rear taillight mounts</li>\n\n\n\n<li>external brake and rear derailleur routing</li>\n\n\n\n<li>internal dynamo wiring through fork &amp; chainstays for integrated lighting setups</li>\n\n\n\n<li>stealth internal dropper post routing</li>\n\n\n\n<li>internal front derailleur routing</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_rear-end-detail.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1333\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_rear-end-detail.jpg\" alt=\"Ten:07 Unicorn Pony Titanium ultra-compact cargo bike, rear end detail\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_rear-end-detail.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_rear-end-detail-297x198.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_rear-end-detail-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_rear-end-detail-120x80.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_rear-end-detail-768x512.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_rear-end-detail-800x533.jpg 800w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_rear-end-detail-720x480.jpg 720w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_rear-end-detail-1350x900.jpg 1350w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>3-pack anything cage mounts on fork legs &amp; downtube for extra carrying capacity</li>\n\n\n\n<li>sliding dropouts and seatstay splitter for belt drive compatibility</li>\n\n\n\n<li>full coverage fender mounts</li>\n\n\n\n<li>double-leg center kickstand mount</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h3>Ten:07 Unicorn Pony Titanium – Availability</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure><a href=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_complete-teaser.jpg\"><img width=\"2000\" height=\"1200\" src=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_complete-teaser.jpg\" alt=\"Ten:07 Unicorn Pony Titanium ultra-compact cargo bike, complete\" srcset=\"https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_complete-teaser.jpg 2000w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_complete-teaser-297x178.jpg 297w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_complete-teaser-1536x922.jpg 1536w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_complete-teaser-120x72.jpg 120w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_complete-teaser-768x461.jpg 768w, https://bikerumor.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Ten07-Unicorn-Pony-Titanium-ultra-compact-cargo-bike_complete-teaser-1500x900.jpg 1500w\" /></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>As of today, this is the only Unicorn Pony Titanium in existence. But Ten:07 plans to put the frameset into production later this year, for deliveries likely in the spring. No pricing has been officially set, as of now.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Pre-orders are expected to open up in Q4 2026. Get in contact with Ten:07 to register your interest in a titanium Unicorn Pony mini cargo bike. And we’ll be keeping an eye on its development.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://ten07.cc/\" target=\"_blank\">Ten07.cc</a></em></p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>","author":"Cory Benson","comments":"https://bikerumor.com/ten07-unicorn-pony-titanium-ultra-compact-all-terrain-cargo-bike-at-bespoked-dresden/#respond","siteTitle":"Bikerumor","siteHash":"49f427af0a926f4232eb837006841d7242e153e3afbb590f32e4b104ea3e2718","entryHash":"16b7e21323d7863a4bc0bb81da215f2aee88e34cfb73a14fada33e7049a44591","category":"Cycling"}